in Human Neuroscience","paperid":"659410","publisher":"Frontiers","status":"p","title":"Frontiers in Human Neuroscience","volume":"15"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85111356107"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-55b2f51e-77c9-481c-a9e6-0d9fb6ff1dde","ku-ccbd4582-07d0-43e1-b597-13eee8532f23"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Decoding EEG Brain Activity for Multi-Modal Natural Language Processing","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-038304","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"We present an open-source toolkit for Danish natural language processing (NLP), enabling easy access to Danish NLP’s latest advancements. The toolkit features wrapper functions for loading models and datasets in a unified way using third-party NLP frameworks. The toolkit is developed to enhance community building, understanding the need from industry and knowledge sharing. As an example of this, we present Angry Tweets: An Annotation Game to increase Danish NLP awareness and create a new sentiment-annotated dataset.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Pauli, Amalie Brogaard","Barrett, Maria","Lacroix, Ophélie","Hvingelby, Rasmus Stig"],"cuid":["S02-098.79-031008"],"event":{"acronym":"NODALIDA","end":"2021-06-02","place":"Reykjavik , is","start":"2021-05-31","title":"The 23rd Nordic Conference on Computational Linguistics","year":"2021"},"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Danish natural language processing","community building in NLP","model and dataset wrappers","open source toolkit","sentiment annotated dataset"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-U"],"level3":{"GTS":["DI-GTS-ALL","DI-GTS-ALX"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-GTS-ALX","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"danlp an open source toolkit for danish natural language processing","src":["au","itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://aclanthology.org/2021.nodalida-main.53.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-098.79-031008","ids":["au-ff8ca969-f6c7-4d20-9e0c-66292806c4d4","itu-5bcdb026-517d-4ad7-9b92-bbee26c898f6"],"keyword":["Danish natural language processing","community building in NLP","model and dataset wrappers","open-source toolkit","sentiment-annotated dataset"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-2-A41EBEBCE50ABAE60D8C3AB557A57E4F"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://aclanthology.org/2021.nodalida-main.53.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"alexandra institute","l2":"DI-GTS","l2n":"GTS Institutes","l3":"DI-GTS-ALX","l3nn":"Alexandra Institute","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Alexandra Institute","namevar":["Alexandra Instituttet A/S"],"nora_code":"DI-GTS-ALX","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Computer Science","IT University of Copenhagen, Data Science, NLPnorth"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Amalie Brogaard","key":"paulipau","last":"Pauli","locid":"6619aaa8-f1c0-4a8a-8d04-23bcf5b0c7ba","name":"Pauli, Amalie Brogaard","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 3","corresponding":null,"first":"Maria Jung","key":"barrettpau","last":"Barrett","locid":"ffc6db77-95ed-452f-92ac-ca143a9db73c","name":"Barrett, Maria Jung","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ophélie","key":"lacroixpau","last":"Lacroix","locid":"022e2ccc-b795-4d15-a0d0-44e7e0cfe23f","name":"Lacroix, Ophélie","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Rasmus Stig","key":"hvingelbypau","last":"Hvingelby","locid":"62d1d108-25d9-4fec-b3fe-23d7a6bd94d9","name":"Hvingelby, Rasmus Stig","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"460-466","place":"Reykjavik, Iceland (Online)","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of the 23rd Nordic Conference on Computational Linguistics (NoDaLiDa)"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All GTS Institutes","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-GTS-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","GTS Institutes","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-ff8ca969-f6c7-4d20-9e0c-66292806c4d4","itu-5bcdb026-517d-4ad7-9b92-bbee26c898f6"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"DaNLP : An open-source toolkit for Danish Natural Language Processing","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-098.79-031008","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"We present a named entity annotation for the Danish Universal Dependencies treebank using the CoNLL-2003 annotation scheme: DaNE. It is the largest publicly available, Danish named entity gold annotation. We evaluate the quality of our annotations intrinsically by double annotating the entire treebank and extrinsically by comparing our annotations to a recently released named entity annotation of the validation and test sections of the Danish Universal Dependencies treebank. We benchmark the new resource by training and evaluating competitive architectures for supervised named entity recognition (NER), including FLAIR, monolingual (Danish) BERT and multilingual BERT. We explore cross-lingual transfer in multilingual BERT from five related languages in zero-shot and direct transfer setups, and we show that even with our modestly-sized training set, we improve Danish NER over a recent cross-lingual approach, as well as over zero-shot transfer from five related languages. Using multilingual BERT, we achieve higher performance by fine-tuning on both DaNE and a larger Bokmål (Norwegian) training set compared to only using DaNE. However, the highest performance is achieved by using a Danish BERT fine-tuned on DaNE. Our dataset enables improvements and applicability for Danish NER beyond cross-lingual methods. We employ a thorough error analysis of the predictions of the best models for seen and unseen entities, as well as their robustness on un-capitalized text. The annotated dataset and all the trained models are made publicly available.","author_count":20,"contributors":["Hvingelby, Rasmus Stig","Pauli, Amalie Brogaard","Barrett, Maria","Rosted, Christina","Lidegaard, Lasse Malm","Søgaard, Anders"],"cuid":["S02-090.62-023335"],"event":{"acronym":"LREC","end":"2020-05-16","place":"Marseille, fr","start":"2020-05-11","title":"12th International Conference on Language Resources and Evaluation, LREC 2020","year":"2020"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Cross lingual transfer","Danish","Named entity recognition","Resource"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-U"],"level3":{"GTS":["DI-GTS-ALL","DI-GTS-ALX"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-GTS-ALX","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"dane a named entity resource for danish","src":["au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"rem","url":"http://www.lrec-conf.org/proceedings/lrec2020/pdf/2020.lrec-1.565.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-090.62-023335","identifier":[{"id":"85092317937","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-9214ab1e-afa6-445c-be29-d63cfe457f02","ku-5b394735-3c4e-4064-8ea1-91aa67dff396"],"keyword":["Cross-lingual transfer","Danish","Named entity recognition","Resource"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-6123F86ED1EFF6801D08C8767F719A05"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"rem","url":"http://www.lrec-conf.org/proceedings/lrec2020/pdf/2020.lrec-1.565.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"alexandra institute","l2":"DI-GTS","l2n":"GTS Institutes","l3":"DI-GTS-ALX","l3nn":"Alexandra Institute","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Alexandra Institute","namevar":["Alexandra Instituttet A/S"],"nora_code":"DI-GTS-ALX","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Computer Science, Machine Learning"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Rasmus Stig","key":"hvingelbypau","last":"Hvingelby","locid":"62d1d108-25d9-4fec-b3fe-23d7a6bd94d9","name":"Hvingelby, Rasmus Stig","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Amalie Brogaard","key":"paulipau","last":"Pauli","locid":"6619aaa8-f1c0-4a8a-8d04-23bcf5b0c7ba","name":"Pauli, Amalie Brogaard","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Maria","key":"barrettpau","last":"Barrett","locid":"45ecfb6f-78b7-405c-8bce-f8003b822bf9","name":"Barrett, Maria Jung","name_org":"Barrett, Maria","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Christina","key":"rostedpau","last":"Rosted","name":"Rosted, Christina","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lasse Malm","key":"lidegaardpau","last":"Lidegaard","name":"Lidegaard, Lasse Malm","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Anders","key":"søgaardpau","last":"Søgaard","locid":"5cfea506-104a-4b40-b63b-e29d037159b0","name":"Søgaard, Anders","orcid":"0000-0001-5250-4276","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Nicoletta","key":"calzolaripedh","last":"Calzolari","name":"Calzolari, Nicoletta","rank":7,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Frederic","key":"bechetpedh","last":"Bechet","name":"Bechet, Frederic","rank":8,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Philippe","key":"blachepedh","last":"Blache","name":"Blache, Philippe","rank":9,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Khalid","key":"choukripedh","last":"Choukri","name":"Choukri, Khalid","rank":10,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Christopher","key":"cieripedh","last":"Cieri","name":"Cieri, Christopher","rank":11,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Thierry","key":"declerckpedh","last":"Declerck","name":"Declerck, Thierry","rank":12,"role":"Editor of Host Publicat